      "subtitle": "An award-winning eye cream designed to hydrate, smooth, and support the delicate eye area. Formulated with hyaluronic acid, botanical extracts, and antioxidant-rich oils, it helps soften the appearance of fine lines and reduce visible signs of fatigue. The silky, fast-absorbing texture melts into the skin, leaving the eye area feeling comfortable, nourished, and refreshed. With regular use, eyes appear brighter, smoother, and more awake. Suitable for morning and evening use.\n\nKey Benefits\n\nSmooths the appearance of fine lines - Hydrating actives and botanical extracts help soften and refine the look of the delicate eye area.\n\nDeeply hydrates & plumps - Hyaluronic acid helps attract and retain moisture for a smoother, more supple appearance.\n\nSupports firmness & elasticity - Sea fennel extract and red algae help support skin resilience and a more toned-looking eye contour.\n\nBrightens & refreshes tired eyes - Antioxidant-rich ingredients help reduce the look of fatigue for a brighter, more awake appearance.\n\nLightweight, fast-absorbing texture - Silky and comfortable for daily use, morning and night, and suitable under makeup.",
